    - target: {fileID: 623570500292232469, guid: c5d26d9f9395dfd4a875f483172f25c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<b><size=42><align=center>SHOPS</align></size></b>


        You may
        see your teammates, friends, or interesting strangers hanging around the
        shops. You can interact with them to learn about the world, build relationships,
        or recruit new allies. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1108484171940093416, guid: c5d26d9f9395dfd4a875f483172f25c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<b><size=42><align=center>SHOPS</align></size></b>\n\nAt shops, you
        can buy and sell items. \n\nSome shops offer <b>special services</b>, like
        repairing weapons.\n\nLook around with <b>Left/Right/Up/Down</b>. \n\nWhen
        you see a point of interest, press <b>Select/Enter</b> to visit.  Press <b>Back/Escape</b>
        to exit."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1108484171940093416, guid: c5d26d9f9395dfd4a875f483172f25c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
